i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JMqx7Qq7sE8Q7kNvwHetKjB&_nc_oc=Adrexr6PuOtx8W0sFGXjj9E61EIH4yFPqMBb8TmxGle9lxLYB46ZLUfhc_splcu1NHA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTRW9W7ljp-cRY6S2cH7b-axFawNYZc-9jPC7Qrxp69Jw&oe=6AEB2EA3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XzsEHSFfs44Q7kNvwH8l3Gz&_nc_oc=AdrQNBn_NY6XJf3U82ZXHpc_D1LwWYRs-TGQ1ObgA7KMLW7fZXCZ94V1OKj30p_74uw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS7sJRokJMoOkVPzXg8rVDPFgy_p1CKfM2Li3trQWYFWQ&oe=6AEB52DD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KN1nnFxb2WwQ7kNvwGhmF1f&_nc_oc=Adpw1tVYooydivaum-BbYj3GgVa-uK91PfjdY1EqzF4b3rWZAXzE0Qg5UxOizbiV8bw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSRGaTTksGqg0FBLN6OV0AmTOXpm5cm-A_0YQnVVHUNOw&oe=6AEB414A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im